 "difference_id": "T29e2fbf2",
 "property_summary": "For any non-empty _tos array, C.transfer always returns true (call succeeds for every iteration) while the mutant may revert due to an out-of-bounds access when loop uses i <= _tos.length, causing transfer to fail for some inputs (arrays with length>0).",
